# Copy values into Cursor MCP env (never commit secrets).
#
# Enable Google Docs API + Google Drive API in Google Cloud Console.
#
# Option A — service account: download JSON, point to it, share each Doc with the SA email.
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/absolute/path/to/service-account.json
#
# Option B — user OAuth (run: npm run oauth-setup after npm run build)
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN=
